         ("fir_newest_tap_and_feedback", "`EDL=1`, `FLG=0`, `FIR7(0x7F)=0x40`, `EFB(0x0D)=0x40`, EVOL=0, MVOL=0, `ram[0x1000..0x1004]=[0x00,0x01,0x00,0x02]`, aucune voix : 1 echantillon -> `ram[0x1000..0x1004]==[0x40,0x00,0x80,0x00]` (fir_l = 0x80, fir_r = 0x100, feedback >> 1 de chaque) ; `take_audio()==[0,0]` (volumes d'echo a 0)."),
